        "answer": {
          "short": "IQR $=5$; lower fence $=-7.5$; upper fence $=12.5$. No outliers.",
          "worked": "$\\begin{aligned}Q_1&=0,\\quad Q_3=5\\\\\\text{IQR}&=5-0=5\\\\\\text{Lower fence}&=0-1.5\\times5=-7.5\\\\\\text{Upper fence}&=5+1.5\\times5=12.5\\end{aligned}$\n\nAll values lie between the fences, so there are no outliers.",
