        "answer": {
          "short": "IQR $=4$; lower fence $=25.5$; upper fence $=41.5$. The only outlier is $20$.",
          "worked": "$\\begin{aligned}Q_1&=\\frac{31+32}{2}=31.5\\\\Q_3&=\\frac{35+36}{2}=35.5\\\\\\text{IQR}&=35.5-31.5=4\\\\\\text{Lower fence}&=31.5-1.5\\times4=25.5\\\\\\text{Upper fence}&=35.5+1.5\\times4=41.5\\end{aligned}$\n\nSince $20<25.5$, the only outlier is $20$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 44
