          "short": "IQR $=9$; lower fence $=47.5$; upper fence $=83.5$. No outliers.",
          "worked": "$\\begin{aligned}Q_1&=\\frac{56+66}{2}=61\\\\Q_3&=\\frac{70+70}{2}=70\\\\\\text{IQR}&=70-61=9\\\\\\text{Lower fence}&=61-1.5\\times9=47.5\\\\\\text{Upper fence}&=70+1.5\\times9=83.5\\end{aligned}$\n\nAll values lie between the fences, so there are no outliers.",
